! mcp_bootstrap_p344.strap -- MCP printed page 344: $DUMP's panel dump,
! first panel line: index-register fields (IT, UB, LB, LZC, AOC, FT)
! are converted to octal through AOCTLC into the print image at $14,
! the line is formatted (AFTRMT) and written (AWRITE); then the second
! panel line ("AC") is begun from APNLW1.  Lines 1-50.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.94, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$DUMP  CARD
! ID VB000085  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 344"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 234772, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  50 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  One
! remark card (line 41, "- PANEL 2ND LINE", no location).  No TAIL
! card.  Located rows run contiguous from 234772.00 (line 1) to
! 235040.00 (line 50, LF, a full word; next location 235041.00), then
! blank paper.  "*" after the LOCATION on lines 14, 27 and 45.  The
! NAME column is blank on every line: the page defines no symbol.
!
! JOIN.  p.343 (no scratch deck; tools/page_sheet.py 343) ends with
! V+I at 234771.40 (a half word): contiguous with line 1.  p.345's
! sheet opens at 235041.00 (SIC,AOCTLB): contiguous with line 50.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "ACCTLC" (B on lines 6, 12, 18, 25) prints its second glyph open;
!     line 32 prints it CLOSED (900 dpi), and the SIC links print
!     "AOCTLB" closed on lines 5, 11, 17, 24, 31.  Written AOCTLC, the
!     AOCTL family C22-6728 names (AOCTLA, AOCTLH, AOCTLS) and landed
!     p.328 spells (AOCTL1, AOCTL2, AOCTLD).  The LAST glyph is a real
!     C, not a worn D: AOCTLD is p.327's 235042.40, and this B lands at
!     235373.40, another address.
!   * the header prints a stray "-" after "PAGE NUMBER 344".
!   * line 27 "AAOC": the third glyph prints closed at 900 dpi; it pairs
!     with line 20's ALZC (left zeros count / all ones count, the
!     $LZC/$AOC fields).  Written AAOC.
!   * octal / hex fields with an open round read 0 ("FC"/"FO" = F0,
!     "5C" = 50, "CO" = 00 on the B rows, ".CC" = .00).
!
! EXTERNALS.  None is defined on a landed page (grep decks/ and the
! scratch neighbours: no hits).  All values come from this page's
! binary; each comment says how much it fixes.  The defining lengths
! are unknown, so the stand-ins carry no dds (every statement here
! that needs one writes it out).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  VB000085 .. VB000126.  Shared serials (each a SIC,B
! pair): lines 5-6 (VB000089), 11-12 (VB000094), 17-18 (VB000099),
! 24-25 (VB000105), 31-32 (VB000111), 37-38 (VB000116), 39-40
! (VB000117), 43-44 (VB000120).  None skipped.

ABUFF   SYN, (8)236044.0             ! not landed; L line 3 ABUFF+1. 236045.00, LF lines 10/16/22 ABUFF+3/+7, LVI line 36 ABUFF+14. -- word-exact
AOCTLB  SYN, (8)235376.40            ! not landed; SIC lines 5,11,17,24,31 235376.40, BIT-EXACT
AOCTLC  SYN, (8)235373.40            ! not landed; B lines 6,12,18,25,32 235373.50, half word only
ALZC    SYN, (8)236223.30            ! not landed; LF line 20 236223.30, BIT-EXACT
AAOC    SYN, (8)236223.60            ! not landed; LF line 27 236223.60, BIT-EXACT
AFTRMB  SYN, (8)235221.0             ! not landed; SIC line 37 235221.00, BIT-EXACT
AFTRMT  SYN, (8)235211.0             ! not landed; B line 38 235211.10, half word only
AWRITB  SYN, (8)235327.40            ! not landed; SIC line 39 235327.40, BIT-EXACT
AWRITE  SYN, (8)235325.40            ! not landed; B line 40 235325.50, half word only
AMNMBF  SYN, (8)236126.0             ! not landed; LVI line 42 236126.35, word address
AINTLB  SYN, (8)235210.40            ! not landed; SIC line 43 235210.40, BIT-EXACT
AINITL  SYN, (8)235205.40            ! not landed; B line 44 235205.50, half word only
APNLW1  SYN(BU), (8)236150.0         ! not landed; LX line 48 236150.02, word address (an LX target is an index word)

